<title>SRI LANKA: Aitken Spence 9-mth net slumps 93.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Aitken Spence 9-mth net slumps 93.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Aitken Spence &amp; Co Ltd for the nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>	     (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Turnover	 2,040.39   vs	 1,971.38</p>
<p>     Net profit	   3.41   vs	    54.68</p>
<p>     Tax provision     13.50   vs	    16.19</p>
<p>NOTE - Aitken Spence &amp; Co Ltd is one of three diversified blue chip holding companies listed in Colombo. Analysts said the company, which depends heavily on tourism, was badly hit by a fall in tourist arrivals after the 1996 Central Bank bomb blast.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
